---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import bgImage from "../assets/bg.jpg";
import Button from "../components/Button.astro";

const title = "Η αντίληψή σου θα γίνει πιο ξεκάθαρη μόνο αν κοιτάξεις μέσα στην ψυχή σου";
const words = title.split(" ");
---

<section
  class="relative flex flex-col items-center justify-center min-h-screen md:text-center px-6 overflow-hidden bg-neutral-50 pt-20 md:pt-0 pb-26"
>
  <Image
    src={bgImage}
    alt=""
    quality="high"
    widths={[480, 800, 1200, 1600, 2400]}
    sizes="100vw"
    loading="eager"
    fetchpriority="high"
    class="absolute inset-0 w-full h-full object-cover pointer-events-none animate-slow-zoom text-transparent"
  />

  <div
    class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-b from-zinc-900/30 via-zinc-900/20 to-zinc-900/40 z-0 pointer-events-none"
  >
  </div>

  <h1
    class="relative z-10 text-3xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl leading-[1.1] max-w-6xl text-accent-100 font-serif flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-x-[0.25em]
     gap-y-2"
  >
    {
      words.map((word) =>
        word === "ψυχή" ? (
          <span class="inline-block text-primary-700 italic">{word}</span>
        ) : (
          <span class="inline-block">{word}</span>
        )
      )
    }
  </h1>

  <p
    class="relative z-10 mt-4 text-sm text-white/70 italic animate-fade-in-up opacity-0 font-medium"
    style="animation-delay: 0.4s; animation-fill-mode: forwards;"
  >
    — Carl Jung
  </p>

  <p
    class="relative z-10 mt-8 text-sm md:text-base text-white/90 leading-relaxed animate-fade-in-up opacity-0 font-medium max-w-4xl"
    style="animation-delay: 0.5s; animation-fill-mode: forwards;"
  >
    Είτε αντιμετωπίζεις καθημερινό άγχος, κρίσεις πανικού και κατάθλιψη, είτε
    βιώνεις συναισθηματικό burnout, δεν χρειάζεται να το περνάς μόνος σου.
    Είμαι εδώ για να σου προσφέρω έναν ασφαλή χώρο (online ή δια ζώσης), όπου
    μαζί θα θεραπεύσουμε το παρόν σου και θα ξεκλειδώσουμε την προσωπική σου
    ανάπτυξη.
  </p>

  <div
    class="relative z-10 mt-5 flex flex-nowrap items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:gap-4 animate-fade-in-up opacity-0"
    style="animation-delay: 0.7s; animation-fill-mode: forwards;"
  >
    <Button href="/about" variant="nav" className="px-3 sm:px-7 py-2 sm:py-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap">Μάθε περισσότερα</Button>
    <Button href="/booking" variant="primary" className="px-3 sm:px-7 py-2 sm:py-3 text-xs sm:text-sm text-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap">Κλείσε ραντεβού</Button>
  </div>

  <div
    class="absolute bottom-0 left-1/2 right-1/2 flex flex-col items-center gap-4 animate-fade-in-up opacity-0"
    style="animation-delay: 1s; animation-fill-mode: forwards;"
  >
    <span
      class="text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.5em] text-white font-bold drop-shadow-[0_4px_6px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)]"
    >
      Δες περισσότερα
    </span>

    <div class="w-[2px] h-12 bg-white/40 relative overflow-hidden rounded-full">
      <div class="absolute top-0 left-0 w-full h-full bg-white animate-scroll-line"></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  
</section>

<style>
  /* New slow zoom animation for the background */
  @keyframes slowZoom {
    from {
      transform: scale(1);
    }
    to {
      transform: scale(1.15);
    }
  }

  .animate-slow-zoom {
    /* 20 seconds for a very subtle, professional feel */
    animation: slowZoom 20s ease-out forwards;
  }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes scrollLine {
    0% { transform: translateY(-100%); }
    50%, 100% { transform: translateY(100%); }
  }

  .animate-fade-in-up {
    animation: fadeInUp 1s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .animate-scroll-line {
    animation: scrollLine 2s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.35, 1) infinite;
  }
</style>